  "scope": "Targeted cross-flow employee obligation comparison; not exhaustive payroll audit or runtime verification.",
  "decision": "Standalone employee payout posts a Settlement debit after checking current ledger balance. Period payroll reads period ledger entries and freezes a payroll net, but PayrollRules subtracts only Deduction and Adjustment, not Settlement. PayPayroll later pays the frozen net without rechecking employee balance. The two supported routes therefore permit a same-current-period earning to be paid through both paths. Source behavior is confirmed; mutual-exclusion policy and end-to-end realization remain unverified.",
